      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. so it's basically just the fat crystals not being stable? i got the temp curves down roughly, but i'm still seeing it show up in some spots more than others. does the \"bloom\" happen because of something specific in the cooling environment or is it more about the molecules themselves?",
